{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":214500,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":9323.17656,"text":"Im Jahr 1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensand zur Liste der gefährdeten Weltkulturerbegebiete hinzugefügt."},{"kind":"text","t":9718.051618,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of endangered World Heritage sites due to the threat from desert sand."},{"kind":"audio","t":9768.668581,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9770.737747,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9772.110596999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9773.597579,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":9775.378091,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9777.035469,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":21405.600187,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film Das Vermächtnis der Tempelritter gesehen haben, denken Sie vielleicht, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte gezeichnet wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":21862.458408,"text":"If you’ve watched the movie “The Templar Legacy,” you might think that a treasure map was drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":21913.967489,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21915.496524,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21917.255544,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21919.035035,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21920.813144,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21922.539245,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21923.458935,"samples":22392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"input","t":34103.254841,"text":"Kinder werden aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien untergebracht, und zwar aus verschiedenen Gründen, die von Vernachlässigung über Missbrauch bis hin zur Erpressung reichen."},{"kind":"text","t":34422.841006,"text":"Children are placed in foster families for a variety of reasons, ranging from neglect and abuse to coercion."},{"kind":"audio","t":34470.974771,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":34473.687242,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34475.087374,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":34476.666494000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34478.448449,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":34479.859236000004,"samples":29960,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":45115.870234,"text":"Das Cochamo-Tal Chiles wichtigstes Kletterziel, bekannt als der Josemite National Park von Südamerika mit einer Vielzahl von großen Granitwänden und Klippen."},{"kind":"text","t":45588.364984,"text":"The Cochamo Valley is Chile’s most important climbing destination, known as South America’s version of Yosemite National Park, featuring numerous large granite walls and cliffs."},{"kind":"audio","t":45642.74137900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45645.05961900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":45646.292509000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45647.973552,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45649.880464,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45651.581918,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45653.358705000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45655.187039000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45656.96148300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":45657.128774000004,"samples":9888,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":52138.403339000004,"text":"Aristoteles' Ansichten zu allen Wissenschaftsfragen einschließlich der Psychologie waren anerkannt."},{"kind":"text","t":52410.97332600001,"text":"Aristotle's views on all scientific matters, including psychology, were recognized."},{"kind":"audio","t":52455.115601000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52456.747029000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52458.433410000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52460.252521,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52461.607775000004,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":62505.84885,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie achtsam. Steiles Gefälle, enge Fahrbahnen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen hier."},{"kind":"text","t":62766.245737000005,"text":"If you’re not used to driving on country roads, stay cautious. Steep slopes, narrow roads, and sharp turns predominate here."},{"kind":"audio","t":62809.722672,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62811.471968000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":62813.212040000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":62813.42159400001,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":62852.955482000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62854.262373000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62855.940883,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":62856.116075000005,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":77491.990935,"text":"Die Gegenwart eines echten, unsichtbaren Teams, Larson und LaFasto, 1989, Seite 109, ist auch ein einzigartiger Bestandteil eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"text","t":78054.584085,"text":"The presence of a real, invisible team—Larson and LaFasto, 1989, page 109—is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":78106.844264,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78108.61597299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78110.33937999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78112.12522,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78113.851531,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78115.64693599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":78117.409852,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":350,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":78119.254441,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78120.534873,"samples":27056,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"input","t":90736.710202,"text":"Nach dem Unfall wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus gebracht. Er verstarb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"text","t":90979.773412,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to a hospital. He passed away shortly after."},{"kind":"audio","t":91024.03506499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":91025.39442499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91027.08386099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":91027.225464,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":91058.853195,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91059.859125,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"audio","t":91060.006866,"samples":464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":101116.84058199999,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren beinhalten außerdem Mandeln, Haselnüsse oder andere Nüsse. Beliebte Kuchen passen häufig besonders gut zu einer Tasse starken Kaffees."},{"kind":"text","t":101434.075308,"text":"Many German baked goods also contain almonds, hazelnuts, or other nuts. Popular cakes often pair especially well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":101480.51720399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101481.982143,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101483.723216,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101485.532171,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":101485.645701,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":101518.165111,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":101519.82985899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101521.606556,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101522.89482,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":107835.213435,"text":"Wenn man eine romanische Sprache spricht, ist es natürlich leichter, Portugiesisch zu erlernen."},{"kind":"text","t":108082.08220599999,"text":"If one speaks a Romance language, it’s naturally easier to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"audio","t":108128.19494799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108129.727709,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":108131.841231,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":108133.798308,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":108134.166201,"samples":7528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":116349.640674,"text":"Die Klang- und Lichtshow bei den Pyramiden ist eine der interessantesten Attraktionen für Kinder in der Gegend."},{"kind":"text","t":116691.08022999999,"text":"The sound and light show at the pyramids is one of the most interesting attractions for children in the area."},{"kind":"audio","t":116736.17696699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116737.800274,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116739.520726,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116741.428219,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":116743.253709,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":116743.57743399999,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":127079.985386,"text":"Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten und der Interaktionen, die zwischen beiden stattfinden."},{"kind":"text","t":127449.161632,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and the interactions that occur between them."},{"kind":"audio","t":127500.316737,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":127501.660968,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127503.337589,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127505.059818,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127506.99275399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":127508.615494,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127510.49720299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":900},{"kind":"audio","t":127510.612287,"samples":4024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":138038.605321,"text":"Der Australier Mitchell Gurley wurde 11. im stehenden Super-G der Männer. Der tschechische Konkurrent Aldrich Jelinek wurde 16. im sitzenden Super-G der Männer."},{"kind":"text","t":138375.691188,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gurley became the 11th. Men's standing Super-G. The Czech competitor Aldrich Jelinek finished in 16th place. Men's sitting Super-G."},{"kind":"audio","t":138418.826855,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":138420.968986,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138422.07960599998,"samples":23264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"audio","t":138466.30382899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138467.53014299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138469.320946,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138471.176516,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":138472.450832,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":540},{"kind":"audio","t":138501.651296,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":138502.131819,"samples":20632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":330},{"kind":"input","t":151337.464102,"text":"Das Haitianische Institut für Gerechtigkeit und Demokratie hat auf unabhängigen Studien verwiesen, die nahelegen, dass das nepalesische UN-Friedensbataillon die Krankheit unwissentlich nach Haiti eingeschleppt hat."},{"kind":"text","t":151765.303442,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy cited independent studies suggesting that the Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion inadvertently brought the disease to Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":151820.272481,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151821.666196,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":151823.33246099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151825.111757,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":151826.89656999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151828.680012,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151830.442602,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":151832.186975,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":151833.983516,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":151834.24455899998,"samples":11088,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":159349.161481,"text":"Bald nach dem Ausbruch von Kampfhandlungen initiierte Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland."},{"kind":"text","t":159613.784286,"text":"Shortly after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain imposed a naval blockade on Germany."},{"kind":"audio","t":159659.737919,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159661.352657,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":159663.024912,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159664.831388,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159666.061858,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":167777.06601,"text":"Er griff auch alles an, was ins Wasser kam. Selbst ein großer Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex war ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"text","t":168102.078564,"text":"He also attacked anything that went into the water. Even a giant dinosaur like the T-Rex wasn’t a match for him."},{"kind":"audio","t":168141.692215,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168143.742588,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168144.694619,"samples":26864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"audio","t":168182.63128899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168184.127469,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168185.848947,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":168186.52961,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":179511.73649399998,"text":"Die Verwendung von Videoaufzeichnungen führte zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen für die Deutung von Mikroexpressionen, wenige Millisekunden dauernden Gesichtsbewegungen."},{"kind":"text","t":179891.187401,"text":"The use of video recordings led to important insights for interpreting microexpressions, facial movements that last just a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"audio","t":179943.508881,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179944.837118,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179946.56960299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179948.31736,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179950.048883,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179951.823101,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179953.6385,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179954.153394,"samples":15424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":189564.699733,"text":"Die Ankündigung erfolgte nach einem Telefongespräch von Trump mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"text","t":189870.013492,"text":"The announcement came after a phone call between Trump and Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"audio","t":189916.809816,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189918.341008,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":189920.099792,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189921.778005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189923.403629,"samples":32728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":199976.21450899998,"text":"Es gibt Familienstrände, die manchmal überlaufen sind, mit einer schönen Einkaufspromenade entlang der Küste, das Schwimmen ist hier sicher."},{"kind":"text","t":200359.985491,"text":"There are family beaches that can be crowded at times, with a nice promenade along the coast; swimming here is safe."},{"kind":"audio","t":200405.083241,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200406.82960599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200408.48443399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200410.295557,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200411.201268,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"audio","t":200442.008154,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200442.448445,"samples":17632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":213755.9968,"text":"Die meisten der kleineren Inseln sind unabhängige Nationen oder zu Frankreich gehörig und als luxuriöse Seebäder bekannt."},{"kind":"text","t":214073.70356999998,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or part of France and are known as luxurious seaside resorts."},{"kind":"audio","t":214122.385959,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":214124.243702,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":214125.678069,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":214127.522471,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":214129.142908,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":214130.926749,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"audio","t":214131.042263,"samples":2592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":224602.606978,"code":1005}]}